{"encoding":"verislop.formalizer-ast/0.1","records":{},"symbols":{"unsupported_domain":{"args":[],"result":"String","body":{"tag":"string","value":"No faithful complete contract can be expressed in the supplied frontend. D1 and A1 require integer-or-null fields preserving JSON null; the supplied sorts have no nullable Int representation with registered JSON-null semantics. O2 and O6 require distinct group names sorted lexicographically for arbitrary strings; sorting and String ordering are unavailable. O3 requires an arbitrarily long arithmetic progression of bucket starts from integer bounds and positive width; no range-generation or recursive construction operation is available. Consequently O4, O5, O6, O7 and I1 cannot be fully specified against the required generated buckets and causal previous values. O1 and R1 additionally require implementation checks for solution.py, Python execution, purity, standard-library-only dependencies and absence of external I/O. These requirements are retained, not weakened or bound to vacuous theorems. A1 still requires a satisfiability witness once its actual schema can be represented. Registered nullable Int semantics, distinct lexicographic String sorting, arithmetic range generation and implementation checks are required before a complete executable contract and bindings for D1, A1, O1, O2, O3, O4, O5, O6, O7, I1 and R1 can be supplied. This envelope reports the unsupported domain and does not claim formalization or acceptance."}}},"predicates":{},"theorems":{},"obligations":{},"witness_obligations":{}}